gcc/ChangeLog:

	* params.opt: Add --param=highcode-gen-section-name=.

gcc/c-family/ChangeLog:

	* c-attribs.cc (handle_section_attribute): Make the exact .highcode
	section uninlinable, and append the declaration name to it when
	--param=highcode-gen-section-name=1.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	* g++.target/riscv/wch-highcode-overload.C: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-always-inline-default.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-always-inline.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-noinline-param0.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-noinline.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-param-range.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-redeclaration.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/riscv/wch-highcode-sections.c: New test.
